new=[('U15','PDF306 attributes certain fevers/lung illness to Saturn/Mercury and recommends cooling; PDF307 recommends heating/softening for Saturn/Mercury origins. Preserve both; intention unresolved.'),('U16','Scorpio/Saturn PDF310 explicitly says no retention of Urine. Draft polarity repaired; modern physiological interpretation remains unspecified.'),('U17','PDF312 visible page label appears279 though sequence278; PDF313 label is partially printed/damaged, appearing29 at sequence279. Original PDF numbers are primary locators.'),('U18','Cooling list has uncertain lexical readings; do not join separate printed rows or substitute confident modern plant identities.'),('U19','Moon decreasing motion and Moon slow motion are distinct local expressions. No numerical threshold or universal equivalence is supplied in these pages.'),('U20','Mars/Aquarius combines a first-square/opposition condition with present remedy after twenty days; geometry and calendar language remain unreconciled.'),('U21','Symptoms, first-person experience and authorial confidence are preserved as claims; no patient denominator or independent outcome verification is supplied.')]
